      kurator.
  - hotspotId: cincin
    partName: Cincin
    localPosition: {x: 0, y: 0.0034999996, z: -0.011075187}
    visibleFrom: 0
    title:
      id: Cincin
      en: Ferrule (cincin)
    regionalTerm: 
    material:
      id: 'Pada model: kuningan dengan dua lis timbul (perlu dikonfirmasi)'
      en: 'On the model: brass with two raised rims (to be confirmed)'
    philosophy:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    craft:
      id: Selongsong logam di pangkal gagang, tempat bilah keluar. Cincin mengikat
        gagang di sekeliling puting agar kayunya tidak pecah. Pada model dibuat dari
        kuningan, seperti kurambiak berpangkal logam pada foto acuan.
      en: The metal collar at the base of the grip, where the blade emerges. It binds
        the grip around the tang so the wood does not split. On the model it is brass,
        like the metal-collared kurambiak in the reference photos.
    history:
      id: '[Draf] Diisi kurator setelah spesimen asli ditetapkan.'
      en: '[Draft] To be written by the curator once the real specimen is chosen.'
    narrationID: {fileID: 0}
    narrationEN: {fileID: 0}
